{"seq":3,"slug":"packaging-data-aggregate","title":"包装数据归集与换算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/epr-environmental-compliance-platform/eco-contribution-declare/packaging-data-aggregate","wordCount":1982,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"包装数据归集与换算\">包装数据归集与换算</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>申报数字不准，绝大多数时候不是费率算错，而是重量来源不对。这一篇讲的是整条回收费链路的数据入口：如何把一件商品拆成<strong>包装组件</strong>，再把组件换算成<strong>计费材质的重量</strong>。它是整个 hub 里最脏的一层数据，因为它的输入来自采购、工艺、供应商与商品运营四个方向的自由文本，而不是结构化的系统字段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"归集的对象-三层包装\">归集的对象：三层包装</h2><p>「包装」不是一个对象，而是三层结构的集合。把它们分开是后续一切计算的前提，因为不同国家对不同层的义务不同（例如运输包装常由承运方或平台承担，商品包装由品牌方承担）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层级</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>典型实物</th>\n<th>常见责任方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一级（商品包装）</td>\n<td>与商品直接接触、构成销售单元的包装</td>\n<td>彩盒、瓶、泡壳</td>\n<td>品牌方 / 生产者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二级（分组包装）</td>\n<td>把若干销售单元组合的包装</td>\n<td>礼盒、束带、托盘</td>\n<td>品牌方 / 门店</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三级（运输包装）</td>\n<td>为运输与配送服务的包装</td>\n<td>快递箱、填充物、胶带、面单</td>\n<td>发货方 / 平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三层必须分别建模，因为它们的<strong>重量要分别计入、责任方可能不同、且部分区域对运输包装有豁免</strong>。把三层混成一个「包装总重」字段，会在需要按层拆分时无法还原。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-bom-到包装组件\">从 BOM 到包装组件</h2><p>数据入口的正确形态是<strong>包装组件清单（packaging component list）</strong>，它是商品 BOM 中包装相关部分的结构化视图。每个组件是一条记录，携带材质、重量、数量与来源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;sku_id&quot;: &quot;SKU-9182&quot;,&#10;  &quot;version&quot;: 4,&#10;  &quot;effective_from&quot;: &quot;2026-07-01&quot;,&#10;  &quot;packaging_level&quot;: &quot;PRIMARY&quot;,&#10;  &quot;components&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;component_id&quot;: &quot;c1&quot;,&#10;      &quot;role&quot;: &quot;outer_box&quot;,&#10;      &quot;material&quot;: &quot;PAPER_CARD&quot;,&#10;      &quot;weight_g&quot;: 42.0,&#10;      &quot;qty&quot;: 1,&#10;      &quot;evidence&quot;: &quot;supplier_spec:SPEC-2026-114&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;component_id&quot;: &quot;c2&quot;,&#10;      &quot;role&quot;: &quot;inner_tray&quot;,&#10;      &quot;material&quot;: &quot;PLASTIC_PET&quot;,&#10;      &quot;weight_g&quot;: 6.5,&#10;      &quot;qty&quot;: 1,&#10;      &quot;evidence&quot;: &quot;measured:sample_lot_A7&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;component_id&quot;: &quot;c3&quot;,&#10;      &quot;role&quot;: &quot;label&quot;,&#10;      &quot;material&quot;: &quot;PAPER_LABEL&quot;,&#10;      &quot;weight_g&quot;: 0.4,&#10;      &quot;qty&quot;: 2,&#10;      &quot;evidence&quot;: &quot;supplier_spec:SPEC-2026-118&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;component_id&quot;: &quot;c4&quot;,&#10;      &quot;role&quot;: &quot;seal&quot;,&#10;      &quot;material&quot;: &quot;PLASTIC_PE&quot;,&#10;      &quot;weight_g&quot;: 0.3,&#10;      &quot;qty&quot;: 1,&#10;      &quot;evidence&quot;: &quot;measured:sample_lot_A7&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"sku_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-9182\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"effective_from\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-01\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"packaging_level\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PRIMARY\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"components\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"component_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"outer_box\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"material\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PAPER_CARD\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"weight_g\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"supplier_spec:SPEC-2026-114\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"component_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"inner_tray\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"material\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PLASTIC_PET\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"weight_g\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"measured:sample_lot_A7\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"component_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"label\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"material\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PAPER_LABEL\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"weight_g\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"supplier_spec:SPEC-2026-118\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"component_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"c4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"role\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"seal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"material\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PLASTIC_PE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"weight_g\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"qty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"measured:sample_lot_A7\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>version</code> + <code>effective_from</code> 的组合是必要的：包装会改版（换供应商、换材料、减量化），而历史销售必须按当时的包装版本计算。若系统只存「当前包装」，重算历史期间就会得出与已提交申报不符的数字。欧盟包装规则正从指令 94/62/EC 切换到直接适用的 <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2025/40/oj/eng\">Regulation (EU) 2025/40</a>，归类口径随之统一，这也要求版本化存档以便回溯过渡期前后的差异。</p>\n<p><code>evidence</code> 字段同样不可省。重量数据的来源只有三类——<strong>供应商规格书、实测称重、估算</strong>——三者的可信度差异极大，而审计与自身质量改进都需要区分它们。把证据类型结构化，就能产出「估算占比」这样的质量指标，驱动后续用实测替换估算。重量数据的规范要求与包装 EPR 的制度演进可参见 <a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2025/40/oj/eng\">Regulation (EU) 2025/40</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"重量口径-净重-毛重与含液\">重量口径：净重、毛重与含液</h3><p>重量口径错误是系统性偏差的最大来源。三个必须区分的概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>组件净重</strong>：组件本身的重量（一个空瓶）。</li>\n<li><strong>含内容物毛重</strong>：组件 + 内容物（装了 200ml 的瓶）。</li>\n<li><strong>商品总毛重</strong>：商品 + 全部包装 + 运输材料。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>回收费通常按<strong>包装组件净重</strong>计算，内容物不计入包装义务（内容物可能另属别的义务链，例如化妆品的容器与内容物各归其类）。因此从物流系统取来的「商品毛重」不能直接用于计费——它是一个包含内容物的数，直接代入会显著高估。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>取数来源</th>\n<th>得到的是</th>\n<th>是否可直接计费</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>物流系统重量</td>\n<td>商品总毛重</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应商规格书</td>\n<td>组件净重（通常）</td>\n<td>是（需核对口径）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>称重实测</td>\n<td>取决于是否含内容物</td>\n<td>需标注</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>估算（按体积/密度）</td>\n<td>粗略净重</td>\n<td>仅作临时值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"组件到计费材质的映射\">组件到计费材质的映射</h2><p>组件材质与计费材质不是一对一。一个「外层彩盒」通常对应计费材质「纸/纸板」，但一个「覆膜纸盒」按国家的费率表可能被归为复合材料。因此需要一张映射表，且它必须<strong>按国家区分</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE packaging_component (&#10;  component_id  BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  sku_id        BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  bom_version   INT NOT NULL,&#10;  level         VARCHAR(12) NOT NULL,   -- PRIMARY|GROUPED|TRANSPORT&#10;  role          VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  material      VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,   -- 组件材质（业务口径）&#10;  weight_kg     NUMERIC(12,6) NOT NULL,&#10;  qty           INT NOT NULL DEFAULT 1,&#10;  evidence_kind VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL,   -- SPEC|MEASURED|ESTIMATED&#10;  effective_from DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  CONSTRAINT chk_evidence CHECK (evidence_kind IN (&#39;SPEC&#39;,&#39;MEASURED&#39;,&#39;ESTIMATED&#39;))&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE material_map (&#10;  market       CHAR(2) NOT NULL,&#10;  material     VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,    -- 组件材质&#10;  fee_material VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,    -- 计费材质（费率表口径）&#10;  is_composite BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT false,&#10;  valid_from   DATE NOT NULL,&#10;  valid_to     DATE,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (market, material, valid_from)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> packaging_component</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  component_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sku_id        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bom_version   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- PRIMARY|GROUPED|TRANSPORT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  role</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">          VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  material      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 组件材质（业务口径）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  weight_kg     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  qty           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  evidence_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- SPEC|MEASURED|ESTIMATED</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chk_evidence </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (evidence_kind </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SPEC'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'MEASURED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ESTIMATED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> material_map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  material     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 组件材质</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  fee_material </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 计费材质（费率表口径）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  is_composite </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_from   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  valid_to     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (market, material, valid_from)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>is_composite</code> 单独成列是为了在映射阶段就阻止「把复合体拆成组分」这一常见误算——当它为真时，该组件的重量整体归到 <code>fee_material</code>（通常是复合材质的兜底类别），不允许再按组分拆分。</p>\n<h3 id=\"映射缺失的处理\">映射缺失的处理</h3><p>真实系统里一定会出现 <code>material_map</code> 里没有的组件材质（新供应商用了新的覆膜工艺）。这时的处理决定了系统是否会静默地系统性低估：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>兜底到「其他」计费材质</strong>：保证必被计费，金额偏高但不错漏。</li>\n<li><strong>兜底到最低费率材质</strong>：会系统性低估，<strong>禁止</strong>。</li>\n<li><strong>拒绝计算并挂起</strong>：最安全，但会阻塞申报，需要配合提醒机制。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>推荐的做法是「兜底到其他 + 挂起提醒」：计算不阻塞（兜底类别给出保守的金额），同时产出一条映射补充工单。这样既不误算成低价，也不让申报卡住。</p>\n<h2 id=\"换算链路\">换算链路</h2><p>从销售明细到计费重量，中间有三次换算，每次都必须可追溯。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[销售明细 按 SKU × 市场 × 期间] --&gt; B[取该时点的 bom_version]&#10;  B --&gt; C[展开 packaging_component 按层与数量]&#10;  C --&gt; D[应用 material_map 得计费材质]&#10;  D --&gt; E[按 level 过滤 该国是否计运输包装]&#10;  E --&gt; F[重量合计 w_m 按计费材质]&#10;  F --&gt; G[写入 contribution_line 含全部溯源字段]\">graph TD\n  A[销售明细 按 SKU × 市场 × 期间] --&gt; B[取该时点的 bom_version]\n  B --&gt; C[展开 packaging_component 按层与数量]\n  C --&gt; D[应用 material_map 得计费材质]\n  D --&gt; E[按 level 过滤 该国是否计运输包装]\n  E --&gt; F[重量合计 w_m 按计费材质]\n  F --&gt; G[写入 contribution_line 含全部溯源字段]</pre><p>第三步 <code>E</code> 是很多人会漏掉的一步：<strong>并非所有国家的义务都覆盖三层包装</strong>。有些制度把运输包装的义务归于发货方或另有专门规则，若不按国家过滤就会多缴。这一步的判据应当来自义务目录的配置，而不是在归集代码里写死。</p>\n<h3 id=\"单位与精度\">单位与精度</h3><p>重量在整条链路里的单位必须固定，只在展示与申报时换算：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存储统一用<strong>千克</strong>，<code>NUMERIC(12,6)</code>（微克级精度，足以表达 0.3 克）；</li>\n<li>组件清单的输入常用<strong>克</strong>，在入库时一次性换算；</li>\n<li>申报表用<strong>吨</strong>，在生成申报表时换算（见 <a href=\"periodic-eco-declaration\">周期性环保数据申报</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>禁止在中间环节混用单位。一次混用（把克当千克）会让金额出现千倍偏差，而在天然带小数的费率下这种错误不一定立刻显形。</p>\n<h2 id=\"数据质量的度量\">数据质量的度量</h2><p>归集层的质量问题不会自己暴露，必须有指标把它们逼出来。四个可用指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>映射覆盖率</td>\n<td>有 <code>material_map</code> 命中的组件占比</td>\n<td>趋近 100%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实测占比</td>\n<td><code>evidence_kind = MEASURED</code> 的重量占比</td>\n<td>持续上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兜底率</td>\n<td>落入「其他」计费材质的重量占比</td>\n<td>低且稳定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本漂移</td>\n<td>在售 SKU 中 BOM 版本过期的占比</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中<strong>兜底率</strong>的趋势最有诊断价值：它突然上升通常意味着某个供应商换了包装材料，而映射表没跟上。把兜底率接到 <a href=\"../green-marking-ops/epr-regulation-update-monitor\">法规变更监控与覆盖率看板</a> 上，可以把数据问题在申报前发现，而不是在收到账单后。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>包装分三层（商品包装、分组包装、运输包装），必须分别建模；混成一个总重字段会在按层判断义务时无法还原。</li>\n<li>归集的数据入口是<strong>包装组件清单</strong>，须携带 BOM 版本与生效日；历史销售按当时版本计算，否则历史申报无法复现。</li>\n<li>重量口径必须区分组件净重与商品毛重；<strong>物流系统的商品毛重不可直接用于计费</strong>，它含内容物，会显著高估。</li>\n<li>组件材质到计费材质需按国家映射；映射缺失应「兜底到其他计费材质 + 挂起提醒」，<strong>禁止兜底到最低费率</strong>（会系统性低估）。</li>\n<li>换算链路须按国家过滤适用层级；存储统一用千克、申报时换算为吨，禁止中间环节混用单位。</li>\n<li>用映射覆盖率、实测占比、兜底率、版本漂移四项指标度量数据质量；兜底率的突升是供应商换料的最早信号。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>重量之后如何乘上费率，见 <a href=\"eco-fee-material-weight\">按材质与重量的回收费计算</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"包装数据归集与换算","id":"包装数据归集与换算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"归集的对象：三层包装","id":"归集的对象-三层包装"},{"level":2,"text":"从 BOM 到包装组件","id":"从-bom-到包装组件"},{"level":3,"text":"重量口径：净重、毛重与含液","id":"重量口径-净重-毛重与含液"},{"level":2,"text":"组件到计费材质的映射","id":"组件到计费材质的映射"},{"level":3,"text":"映射缺失的处理","id":"映射缺失的处理"},{"level":2,"text":"换算链路","id":"换算链路"},{"level":3,"text":"单位与精度","id":"单位与精度"},{"level":2,"text":"数据质量的度量","id":"数据质量的度量"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"周期性环保数据申报","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/epr-environmental-compliance-platform/eco-contribution-declare/periodic-eco-declaration"},"next":{"title":"回收标识与材质标注规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/epr-environmental-compliance-platform/green-marking-ops/recycle-mark-material-label"}}